  "decision": "Both legacy bare entries contain only exact UA26 Armor Class Table references listed in the independently reviewed UA26 central receipt under collection=equipment, and each matches one original reference path on both colliding records. Preserve their original values here, apply the same references only to equipment:<id>, and leave the rules:<id> record without the equipment reference. No other ambiguous citation item entries are migrated by this change.",
